{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>And the sons of Korah did not die.</b> And the witness is Samuel and his sons and his grandsons, who are the singers, and they are called the Korahites. \"Of the sons of Korah, a psalm.\" Also in the Torah it is written, \"the Korahite family.\" And Scripture mentioned \"and the sons of Korah\" together with the sons of Reuben because the sons of Dathan and Abiram, great and small, died. Now the evil of Dathan and Abiram was worse than the evil of Korah."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 26, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:32.308249011Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}